  "body": "When querying the `/messages` endpoint, the events in the `chunk` in the response will include a `user_id` field which duplicates the `sender` field. The `user_id` field is not listed in the spec (nor shown in its examples), and so should probably be removed?\r\n\r\nRelated: #7606?",
